-- and the signal count of a molecule at a temperature under a setting: the motions evaluated there, then
-- the same admission test. The count is a function of the molecule's motions, the temperature and the
-- observation, and of nothing else.
signals-at : Nat → List TempMotion → List Nat → Nat → Setting → Nat
signals-at n ms hs t c = signals-under n (chem-map TempMotion Motion (λ q → tm-at t q) ms) hs c
